@startuml
left to right direction
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam handwritten false

actor Agent
actor Admin as "Administrator"
actor Client
Agent <|-- Admin

usecase UC1 as "View Reservation List"
usecase UC2 as "View Reservation Details"
usecase UC3 as "Update Reservation Status"
usecase UC4 as "Delete Reservation"
usecase UC5 as "Create Reservation"
usecase UC6 as "Search Available Vehicles"

Agent --> UC1
Agent --> UC2
Agent --> UC3
Agent --> UC4

Client --> UC1
Client --> UC2
Client --> UC5
Client --> UC6

note right of Agent
  Agents can only manage reservations
  for vehicles in their own office.
end note

note right of Admin
  Administrators can manage all reservations.
  (Inherits all Agent permissions)
end note

note right of Client
  Clients can create and view their own
  reservations, and search for available vehicles.
  System automatically calculates rental prices.
end note

@enduml 